OL,3,GNEWSAPub dog helps find missing black
OL,4,Apudding trophy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub dog helped uncover a trophy which
OL,7,Fdisappeared during the Black Pudding
OL,8,FThrowing Championships after she began
OL,9,Fsniffing around a seat where it had
OL,10,Fbeen left among toilet rolls.
OL,12,FDaisy, a Jack Russell-Chihuahua cross,
OL,13,Fcaught the attention of The Oaks
OL,14,Flandlady Jessica Murray on Monday
OL,15,Fevening at the Ramsbottom pub.
OL,17,FWhen Murray investigated, she found the
OL,18,Fmissing cup in a storage alcove beneath
OL,19,Fa lift-up seat, alongside toilet rolls
OL,20,Fkept there.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
